#: src/features/Blog/Articles/phrases-for-an-interview.tsx:25
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"The first few minutes of an interview are often dedicated to casual "
"conversation — also known as 'SmallTalk'. Recruiters use this time to "
"create a friendly atmosphere and get to know you a bit better."
msgstr ""
